Mohon bantuanmu.

132
00:08:12,241 --> 00:08:13,075
Apa?

133
00:08:14,452 --> 00:08:15,369
Sial.

134
00:08:17,371 --> 00:08:18,206
Jadi,

135
00:08:18,915 --> 00:08:20,166
