153
00:09:33,239 --> 00:09:36,033
Ya, itu. Kau pasti sering dibilang
mirip itu, 'kan?

154
00:09:36,117 --> 00:09:38,077
Aku mengidap sindrom Asperger.

155
00:09:38,160 --> 00:09:42,206
Aku sulit memahami emosi
dan berinteraksi sosial.

156
00:09:42,290 --> 00:09:43,124
